automx 1.2.0
===========

This release is a ground-up modernization of the established automx service.
It requires CPython 3.14, runs as a pure FastAPI/ASGI application, and replaces
the historical shell client with the modular `automx` operator CLI.

Protocol work includes Mail Autoconfig XML 1.2, corrected Outlook and
MobileSync Autodiscover XML, an opt-in experimental Autodiscover v2 subset,
PACC-02 with exact UAAC1 DNS digests, OAuth public-client/DCR metadata, and
password-free Apple Mobileconfig profiles.

Deployment now includes a hardened non-root container, a Docker Compose E2E
stack, deterministic OpenAPI export, SPDX and CycloneDX SBOM targets, and
vulnerability/secret scan gates. Review `docs/migration.md` before upgrading.

The IETF specifications used by several features are Internet-Drafts. Their
exact pinned versions are listed in `docs/protocols/status.md`.
